# Manual permission mode: decline one prompt with feedback, accept the next
# with "don't ask again", then check the /permissions dialog.
@real
@size 140x45
@fixture qa/fixtures/real/wf-manual-permissions
@args --permission-mode manual
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
SHOT ready
SEND Extend the doc comment on Count in notes.go to say it returns 0 for a nil slice, then run `go test ./...` to confirm it still passes.
WAITFOR /Allow kiln to/ 60
SHOT first-prompt
KEY tab
TYPE Don't touch that file yet, just tell me your plan first.
KEY enter
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 120
SHOT after-decline
EXPECT_NOT /What should I do instead/
SEND Plan looks good, go ahead.
WAITFOR /Allow kiln to/ 120
SHOT second-prompt
KEY 2
IDLE 180
SHOT after-permissions
SEND /permissions
WAIT 2
SHOT permissions-dialog
EXPECT /mode\s+manual/
KEY esc
IDLE 30
